{"version":1,"key":"card:649","content":{"id":649,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"想象你在一个滑梯的顶端，一旦你做了一个小小的让步或尝试（向前迈了一小步），由于重力作用，你会不由自主的沿着滑梯向下滑。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e0ffa530-2abd-40dd-a525-789f87e86450","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"滑梯效应就是你从一个小的让步开始：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c399cae5-40d3-4655-b459-3737fa494138","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"吃一口零食没事的","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"eabf341f-2edf-439c-ae50-ee5b60802661","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"dd64015c-593c-4338-bc4f-e45eb9561ea5","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"今天少做一道题也没关系","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1120b500-118b-43fc-a75d-46351718cb5d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"0bb2f69d-29dd-419b-86f9-5fe9811f5a76","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"截止日期还早，先打会儿游戏吧","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"256b8821-459f-4917-866a-5e17b623340a","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"101bb8dd-f0d9-463c-a9a9-1010eb09ff1b","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"7aa68bf9-672f-471e-a8cd-54a649b90714","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"然后引发了一系列的连锁反应：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1beef781-91c7-4